Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.21,0:00:02.35,Midnight,,0,0,0,,Elias's paper had his obituary.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.83,0:00:05.07,Midnight,,0,0,0,,It arrived a day\Nearly: his name,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.27,0:00:07.51,Midnight,,0,0,0,,his apartment, a fire at 3:07.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.35,0:00:09.03,Midnight,,0,0,0,,He was alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.28,0:00:11.19,Midnight,,0,0,0,,He had no subscription.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.22,0:00:13.33,Midnight,,0,0,0,,Underneath, in small print:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.36,0:00:15.10,Midnight,,0,0,0,,one name per fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.62,0:00:18.24,Midnight,,0,0,0,,At 2:40, Elias knocked on 4A.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.86,0:00:20.82,Midnight,,0,0,0,,Mara's heater had been\Nsparking all week.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.14,0:00:22.46,Midnight,,0,0,0,,She'd asked him to fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.72,0:00:24.06,Midnight,,0,0,0,,He told her to call the super.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.56,0:00:25.32,Midnight,,0,0,0,,He took the stairs
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.36,0:00:26.54,Midnight,,0,0,0,,and didn't look back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.92,0:00:27.88,Midnight,,0,0,0,,From the hotel, he
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.92,0:00:29.28,Midnight,,0,0,0,,watched the smoke rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.92,0:00:32.02,Midnight,,0,0,0,,At 3:07, 4B burned.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.66,0:00:33.56,Midnight,,0,0,0,,The next paper waited
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.60,0:00:34.66,Midnight,,0,0,0,,at the front desk.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.08,0:00:36.03,Midnight,,0,0,0,,Same fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.32,0:00:37.10,Midnight,,0,0,0,,Same hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.28,0:00:37.99,Midnight,,0,0,0,,Different name.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.16,0:00:40.06,Midnight,,0,0,0,,Mara Kwan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.08,0:00:41.44,Midnight,,0,0,0,,Apartment 4A.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.66,0:00:42.48,Midnight,,0,0,0,,It said she'd entered
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.50,0:00:43.92,Midnight,,0,0,0,,4B to warn him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.48,0:00:45.26,Midnight,,0,0,0,,Elias laid the two
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.28,0:00:47.14,Midnight,,0,0,0,,obituaries side by side.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.48,0:00:48.14,Midnight,,0,0,0,,His name.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.34,0:00:49.08,Midnight,,0,0,0,,Mara's.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.91,0:00:51.97,Midnight,,0,0,0,,The paper wasn't\Npredicting the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.43,0:00:54.37,Midnight,,0,0,0,,It was choosing who paid for it.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:55.20,Midnight,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,78)\fs26\alpha&HCA&\bord0\shad0\fsp4}THE MIDNIGHT ARCHIVE
